## Notes

- Error precedence: a parse failure throws `TypeError` even if the same range would also be end-before-start, since parsing comes first.
- I chose message texts not specified by the requirements (`... does not parse as a date`, `end is before start`); only the "includes the offending value" part was mandated, and the tests assert that.

